  "_note": "ARTIFACTS READ BY HAND OFF THE RENDERED PAGE. The slow answer key. Every value here was transcribed by looking at the image, never copied from an engine's output. `alts` are renderings that still carry the fact (spacing, punctuation, common OCR-plausible variants). `ambiguous` entries could not be resolved by the reader either, so NO engine is credited or penalised for them.",
  "_scoring": "An engine scores a hit when the value or any alt appears in its text, normalised for case/whitespace/punctuation. Tiers: CRITICAL = lineage or parcel-matching breaks without it. MATERIAL = a function agent wants it. ROUTINE = boilerplate.",
